  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Centre for Trade and Sustainable    Development 2013-2015, ICTSD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Centre for Trade and Sustainable    Development, ICTSD 2013-2015 - ICTSD 2013-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICTSD aims to influence the international trading system so that it   promotes the goal of sustainable development. ICTSD is an independent NGO, which strives to empower (marginalized) policy makers and policy influencers in the trade policy arena, through information,           networking, dialogue, targeted research and capacity building.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICTSD arbetar med att p&#xe5;verka det internationella handelssystemet s&#xe5;  att det fr&#xe4;mjar m&#xe5;let om en h&#xe5;llbar utveckling. ICTSD &#xe4;r en oberoende enskild organisation, som arbetar med att st&#xe4;rka kunskapen hos        relevanta (marginaliserade) beslutsfattare och lobbyister p&#xe5; den      handelspolitiska arenan genom information, dialog, n&#xe4;tverkande,       riktad forskning, omv&#xe4;rldsanalys och kapacitetsuppbyggnad.</narrative>
  </description>
